ore you actually  move forward  is to have self-awareness about what  makes you happy  before you even get into the business  model this is so  important because chronologically  what you might not see is what it looks  like five years from now 10 years from  now  15 years from now once you know what  makes you happy  this is the best best starting place  because you don't want to create a  business model that in five years  when it's successful it's out of  alignment with your family or your  personal life  and then you're kind of stuck and you're  trapped so  for me i had seven hundred thousand  dollars in debt  i knew like we spoke about before that i  wanted to make these liquid vitamins  and it's very difficult to find a  manufacturer  who usually you need something like  twenty thousand dollars to do a custom  blend run of vitamins  and you were calling manufacturers oh  that's right drew i  called all over for six months with the  help of my husband  we found one manufacturer in california  and i said  listen i know you don't know me i  promise  if you make me 90 bottles just 90  bottles of this liquid  vitamin gluten-free organic sugar-free  sugar-free was the key um i promise that  someday it will be your  biggest account and i eventually was the  biggest account but at the time i mean  90 bottles i take them to my office i  sell them  some of my clients reviewed it on amazon  but at the time  amazon is not cool then this was 2014.  and i remember crying so hard the first  weekend i saw  i sold like 280 worth of vitamins  and i saw just a small way  to move forward out of this debt it's  it's about patience  and a lot of hard work and now in 2021  we have over 90  amazing amazing marry with organics  employees  i love you so much i'm so inspired by  you  thank you for having me i love your book  these 12 steps  just click with me they're doable i love  them  please check out mary  maryruthorganics.com and to find out all  about her products  and her new boo